{title: Samajavaragamana}
{artist: Sid Sriram Telugu}
{key: A#m}

{c: Verse 1}
Nee [A#m] kaallani pattuku vadalanannavi,        [C#] Choode naa kallu
Aa [G#] choopulanalla thokkuku vellaku,        [D#] Dayaledha asalu
Nee [A#m] kaallani pattuku vadalanannavi,        [C#] Choode naa kallu
Aa [G#] choopulanalla thokkuku vellaku,        [D#] Dayaledha asalu
Nee [A#m] kallaki kaavaali,        Kaasthaaye [C#] kaatukala naa kalalu
Nuvvu [G#] nulumuthunte yerraga kandhi,        [D#] Chindhene segalu
Naa [A#m] oopiri gaaliki,        Uyyaalalooguthu [C#] unte mungurulu
Nuvvu [G#] nettesthe ela nittoorchavatte,        [D#] Nishtoorapu vilavilalu
[A#m] Samajavaragamana,        Ninu [C#] choosi aaga galana
[G#] Manasu meeda vayasukunna,        [D#] Adupu cheppa thaguna
Nee [A#m] kaallani pattuku vadalanannavi,        [C#] Choode naa kallu
Aa [G#] choopulanalla thokkuku vellaku,        [D#] Dayaledha asalu
Mallela [A#m] maasama, Manjula [C#] haasama,        Prathi [G#] malupulona yeduru padina
[D#] Vannela vanamaa,        Virisina [A#m] pinchamaa, Virula [C#] prapanchama
[G#] Ennenni vanne chinnelante,        [D#] Ennela vashama
Arey [A#m] naa gaale thagilina,        [C#] Naa neede thariminaa
[G#] Vulakavaa, palakavaa [D#] bhaamaa,        [A#m] Entho brathimaalina
[C#] Inthena anganaa,        [G#] Madhini meetu madhuramaina
[D#] Manavini vinumaa,        [A#m] Samajavaragamana
Ninu [C#] choosi aaga galana,        [G#] Manasu meeda vayasukunna
[D#] Adupu cheppa thaguna,        Nee [A#m] kaallani pattuku vadalanannavi
